        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 38 · AI File Organizer\nSuggests a clean file name, folder path and tags for every uploaded file based on its name and content preview.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/file-organizer` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"filename\": \"IMG_2231.pdf\",\n \"mime_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n \"preview\": \"Salary slip for October 2026, Employee ID 1043...\"\n}\n```"
      }
